---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | Veloce Tools"
  description="Terms for using the free tools on Veloce Tools."
>
  <section class="section--tight prose">
    <div class="tool-hero">
      <h1 style="font-size:40px;">Terms of Use</h1>
    </div>

    <h2>Use at your own discretion</h2>
    <p>Veloce Tools is provided free of charge, as-is, with no warranty. Tools like the password generator, hash generator, and others handle data locally in your browser, but you're responsible for how you use their output (for example, storing generated passwords securely).</p>

    <h2>No guarantee of accuracy</h2>
    <p>We aim for these tools to be accurate and reliable, but we don't guarantee it. Anything security- or SEO-related (password strength, meta tag correctness, site health checks) should be treated as a helpful starting point, not a substitute for professional review.</p>

    <h2>Fair use</h2>
    <p>Please don't use automated scripts to hammer these tools at high volume — they're free for people to use directly, not as a backend for your own product.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>These terms may be updated as new tools are added. Continued use of the site means you accept the current terms.</p>

    <p>Veloce Tools is a project by <a href="https://velocedigital.co" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="text-decoration:underline;">Veloce Digital</a>.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
